{
  "headline": "Ephedrine sulfate is not on FDA's shortage list as of 2026-10-21; supply traces to a registered plant with VAI inspections through 2024-07-25",
  "headline_cites": ["D3", "E9"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's drug shortage list does not include ephedrine sulfate as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The product used at both Corvale sites carries NDC 68083061010 and is labeled by Gland Pharma Limited.",
      "cites": ["E1", "E2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The registered manufacturing plant for this NDC is Gland Pharma Limited (FEI 3002647489) in India.",
      "cites": ["E9"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection records for that plant show a series of VAI classifications, most recently an inspection ending 2024-07-25 with classification VAI known to FDA on 2025-01-15.",
      "cites": ["E8"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 33 vials of the 5 mg/mL 10 mL presentation, providing 6.6 days of supply at current use.",
      "cites": ["D1"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale General holds 111 vials of the same presentation, providing 18.6 days of supply.",
      "cites": ["D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The recommended action is to transfer 27 vials from Corvale General to Corvale East, which would raise East's coverage to about 12 days while General retains roughly two weeks of supply.",
      "cites": ["D4"]
    }
  ]
}
